# Project context ingestion (WF-01)

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-A2-project-context-ingestion.md`. Prompt: `docs/spec-references/WF-01-context-ingestion.md`. Inherits WF-00.

Drop any file/link → detect type → parse → understand (gated `claudeCall`, source `ingest.understand`) → embed (Voyage/pgvector) → link to shot plan, VaultCharacter, VaultLocation, premise-lock, style, notes, or Training Studio voice candidates. The orchestrator (OR-01/OR-02/OR-06) reads it via `loadProjectGenerationContext` and `queryProjectRAG`. Content is the user's. Overlay still wins. Do not start WF-02 from this rule.
